        "kind": "body",
        "text": "AWS Weekly Roundup: GPT-6.1 Terra on Bedrock, Step Functions as agent tools, and more (November 2, 2026)",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/aws-weekly-roundup-gpt-6-1-terra-on-bedrock-step-functions-as-agent-tools-and-more-november-2-2026/",
