        "checkedAt": "2026-11-02T20:19:34.182Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "AWS Step Functions , which already orchestrates over 220 AWS services, can now be handed to an agent as a tool, so workflows teams already trust became callable without a rewrite.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/aws-weekly-roundup-gpt-6-1-terra-on-bedrock-step-functions-as-agent-tools-and-more-november-2-2026/",
        "source": "AWS News Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-02T16:45:48.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-02T20:19:34.182Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "OpenAI GPT-6.1 Terra is now generally available on Amazon Bedrock , and what interests me is where it sits rather than what it tops.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/aws-weekly-roundup-gpt-6-1-terra-on-bedrock-step-functions-as-agent-tools-and-more-november-2-2026/",
        "source": "AWS News Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-02T16:45:48.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-02T20:19:34.182Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In OpenAI’s Agents’ Last Exam evaluation it scored 15 percentage points higher than GPT-5.6 Terra, performed on par with GPT-6 Astra, and completed tasks more than three times faster than both.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/aws-weekly-roundup-gpt-6-1-terra-on-bedrock-step-functions-as-agent-tools-and-more-november-2-2026/",
        "source": "AWS News Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-02T16:45:48.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-02T20:19:34.182Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The price is what I would check first: input and output tokens are at least 50% lower than GPT-6.1 Sol and GPT-5.6 Terra.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/aws-weekly-roundup-gpt-6-1-terra-on-bedrock-step-functions-as-agent-tools-and-more-november-2-2026/",
        "source": "AWS News Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-02T16:45:48.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-02T20:19:34.182Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "AWS Step Functions workflows are now available as AI agent tools through Amazon Bedrock AgentCore Gateway, which connects agents to tools over the Model Context Protocol (MCP).",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/aws-weekly-roundup-gpt-6-1-terra-on-bedrock-step-functions-as-agent-tools-and-more-november-2-2026/",
        "source": "AWS News Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-02T16:45:48.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-02T20:19:34.182Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "AWS Lambda supports Seekable OCI (SOCI) lazy loading for Lambda Managed Instances – You can now have AWS Lambda fetch only the files needed at each stage of startup instead of pulling a whole container image first, which AWS puts at up to 70% off container startup time.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/aws-weekly-roundup-gpt-6-1-terra-on-bedrock-step-functions-as-agent-tools-and-more-november-2-2026/",
        "source": "AWS News Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-02T16:45:48.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-02T20:19:34.182Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "How Nubank automated disaster recovery with the AWS DevOps Agent – Nubank serves more than 140 million customers across Brazil, Mexico, and Colombia, and classifies over 300 business flows as critical, each tested on a regulator’s schedule.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/aws-weekly-roundup-gpt-6-1-terra-on-bedrock-step-functions-as-agent-tools-and-more-november-2-2026/",
        "source": "AWS News Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-02T16:45:48.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-02T20:19:34.182Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Nubank reports that handing evidence collection and report writing to the AWS DevOps Agent cut a test cycle from about 4.3 hours to roughly 40 minutes, and quadrupled flow coverage in 2026 to more than 160.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/aws-weekly-roundup-gpt-6-1-terra-on-bedrock-step-functions-as-agent-tools-and-more-november-2-2026/",
        "source": "AWS News Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-02T16:45:48.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-02T20:19:34.182Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "How MoEngage turned over 400 APIs into agent tools with AgentCore Gateway – Roughly 400 internal REST API operations, built by 25 teams, sitting in private VPCs across seven Regions, with tenant identity that could never become a parameter the model gets to set.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/aws-weekly-roundup-gpt-6-1-terra-on-bedrock-step-functions-as-agent-tools-and-more-november-2-2026/",
        "source": "AWS News Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-02T16:45:48.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-02T20:19:34.182Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E12",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "AWS re:Invent – re:Invent returns to Las Vegas from November 30 to December 4, with more than 2,200 sessions.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/aws/aws-weekly-roundup-gpt-6-1-terra-on-bedrock-step-functions-as-agent-tools-and-more-november-2-2026/",
